WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.620
Manon dashes as Ryu lands from heavy Rond-point.

2
00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:01.250
A short forward walk brings Manon into command-grab range as Ryu wakes up.

3
00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:02.450
Light Manège Doré catches Ryu after the dash and walk.

4
00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:03.100
The command grab finishes, and the medal counter has risen from one to two.
